            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        2 Bakyab 23:36—24:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.5+2CH.36.6+2CH.36.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byom 36:5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yehoiakimu mutabane wa Yosia bwe yali nga ni kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya, Musengwa Katonda yankoba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yeremia, ja y'ab'ekika kya Rekabu oyogere nabo. Memale obatwale mu kisenge ekindi ku ebyo ebiri ku isinzizo, obaghe ku mwenge ogw'emizabbibu banhwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale naatoola ab'ekika kya Rekabu boonaboona: Yaazania mutabane wa Yeremia atali nze aye mutabane wa Habazzinia, ni baganda be, ni batabane baibwe boonaboona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naabatwala mu isinzizo. Agho naabaingiza mu kisenge ky'abeegeresebwa ab'omulanzi ayetebwa Hanani mutabane wa Igadalia. Ekisenge ekyo kyali ghaigulu gh'ekisenge kya Maaseia mutabane wa Shallumu eyakuumanga omulyango gw'eisinzizo. Era nga kiri kumpi n'ebisenge eby'abakungu abandi ab'omu isinzizo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho naata ensugha n'ebikopo mu maiso g'Abarekabu abo, nga biidhwire omwenge ogw'emizabbibu, era naabakoba nti: “Munhwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye bairamu bati: “Ife titwidha kunhwa mwenge gwa mizabbibu, kuba dhaadha waife Yonadabu mutabane wa Rekabu, yatukoba ife beene, n'abaana baife, era ni baidhukulu baife, obutanhwanga mwenge gwa mizabbibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekindi yatukoba obutazimbanga ndhu, n'obutalimanga nimiro, oba okusimbanga amasamba g'emizabbibu, waire okugagula obugule. Yatulagira tusulenga mu weema buliidho, olwo tusobole okusigala nga tukaali mu nsi eno mwe tuli ng'abasenze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale tugondera ebyo byonabyona dhaadha waife Yonadabu bye yatulagira. Ife beene, ni bakazi baife, ni batabane baife, era ni baghala baife, titunhwera irala ku mwenge gwa mizabbibu naire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era titwezimbira ndhu dha kubangamu, waire okuba n'amasamba g'emizabbibu, oba enimiro, oba ensigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye tusula mu weema, era tugondera byonabyona Yonadabu dhaadha waife bye yatulagira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye kyabazinga Nebukadinezzari ow'e Babilonia bwe yaidha n'alumba ensi eno, ife twasalagho okwidha e Yerusalemu nga tulumuka amagye ag'Abababilonia n'ag'Abasiria. Kale n'okuba nti buti tuba mu Yerusalemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yankoba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yeremia, Nze Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye, Katonda wa Isiraeli nkulagiire oje obuuze abantu b'omu Buyudaaya n'ab'omu Yerusalemu ensonga lwaki baloba okuwulira bye mbalagira ni bye mbagalagira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baidhukulu ba Yonadabu mutabane wa Rekabu baagondera ekiragiro kya Yonadabu oyo eky'obutanhwanga mwenge gwa mizabbibu. Era ni ye buli eno tibagunhweraku irala naire. Aye imwe nze buliidho mbakoba aghazira kukoogha naire, aye mwaloba kumpulirisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buliidho mbaire ntumanga ye muli abagheereza bange abalanzi aghazira kukoogha naire, babakobe mulekere okukola ebibi, mukole ebituufu. Era mulobe kujiiranga ku bakatonda abandi nga mubasinza, olwo musobole okusigalanga mu nsi ye nabagha imwe ni badhaadha baimwe. Aye nga imwe timumpulirisa, waire okufaayo ku bye nkoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baidhukulu ba Yonadabu mutabane wa Rekabu baagondera ekiragiro dhaadha waibwe kye yabagha, aye abantu imwe mwadheema okukola bye mbalagira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni, nze Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye, Katonda wa Isiraeli, nja kutuusa abantu b'omu Buyudaaya n'ab'omu Yerusalemu ku kuzikirira, nga bwe nabeesoomera eira. Kino nja kukikola lwa kuba nayogera n'imwe aye mwaloba kumpulirisa, era naabeeta aye mwaloba kunvugira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho naakobera ab'ekika kya Rekabu nti: “Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye, Katonda wa Isiraeli, akoba ati, ‘Mwagondera ebyo dhaadha waimwe Yonadabu bye yabakoba okukola, era mwajiira ku ebyo byonabyona bye yabalagira ni bye yabagalagira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni, nze Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye, Katonda wa Isiraeli, nsuubiza nti buliidho ghaidha kubangagho omusaadha ku baidhukulu ba Yonadabu mutabane wa Rekabu, anampeerezanga.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
